  "text": "```verilog\nmodule apbslave #(\n\tparameter\tC_APB_ADDR_WIDTH = 12,\n\tparameter\tC_APB_DATA_WIDTH = 32,\n\tlocalparam\tAW = C_APB_ADDR_WIDTH,\n\tlocalparam\tDW = C_APB_DATA_WIDTH,\n\tlocalparam\tAPBLSB = $clog2(C_APB_DATA_WIDTH)-3\n) (\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPCLK, PRESETn,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPSEL,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPENABLE,\n\toutput\treg\t\t\tPREADY,\n\tinput\twire\t\t[AW-1:0]\tPADDR,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPWRITE,\n\tinput\twire\t\t[DW-1:0]\tPWDATA,\n\tinput\twire\t\t[DW/8-1:0]\tPWSTRB,\n\tinput\twire\t\t[2:0]\t\tPPROT,\n\toutput\treg\t\t[DW-1:0]\tPRDATA,\n\toutput\twire\t\t\tPSLVERR\n);\n\n\tlocalparam\tNUM_BYTES = DW/8;\n\tlocalparam\tNUM_WORDS = NUM_BYTES/APBLSB;\n\tlocalparam\tWORD_MASK = { {APBLSB{1'b1}}, {APBLSB{1'b0}} };\n\n\treg\t[AW-1:0]\tADDR_REG;\n\treg\t[DW-1:0]\tDATA_REG;\n\treg\t[DW/8-1:0]\tWSTRB_REG;\n\treg\t[2:0]\t\tPROT_REG;\n\treg\t\t\tWRITE_ENABLE;\n\treg\t\t\tTRANSACT_COMPLETE;\n\treg\t\t\tTRANSACT_ERROR;\n\treg\t\t\tTRANSACT_ACTIVE;\n\n\t// State machine\n\tlocalparam\tIDLE = 2'b00;\n\tlocalparam\tACCESS = 2'b01;\n\tlocalparam\tREAD_DATA = 2'b10;\n\tlocalparam\tWRITE_DATA = 2'b11;\n\n\treg\t[1:0]\tSTATE;\n\n\t// Synchronous Reset\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tADDR_REG <= 0;\n\t\t\tDATA_REG <= 0;\n\t\t\tWSTRB_REG <= 0;\n\t\t\tPROT_REG <= 0;\n\t\t\tWRITE_ENABLE <= 0;\n\t\t\tTRANSACT_COMPLETE <= 0;\n\t\t\tTRANSACT_ERROR <= 0;\n\t\t\tTRANSACT_ACTIVE <= 0;\n\t\t\tSTATE <= IDLE;\n\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\tPRDATA <= 0;\n\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\tend\n\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t// Address and control registers update on every cycle if selected\n\t\t\tif (PSEL && PENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\tADDR_REG <= PADDR;\n\t\t\t\tDATA_REG <= PWDATA;\n\t\t\t\tWSTRB_REG <= PWSTRB;\n\t\t\t\tPROT_REG <= PPROT;\n\t\t\t\tWRITE_ENABLE <= PWRITE;\n\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t// State machine logic\n\t\t\tcase (STATE)\n\t\t\t\tIDLE: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tif (PSEL && PENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTRANSACT_ACTIVE <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTRANSACT_COMPLETE <= 0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTRANSACT_ERROR <= 0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= (PWRITE) ? WRITE_DATA : READ_DATA;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t\tACCESS: begin\n\t\t\t\t\t// Simulate access phase duration (at least 1 cycle)\n\t\t\t\t\t// In a real implementation, this might depend on address decoding\n\t\t\t\t\t// For this generic slave, we assume immediate transition after setup\n\t\t\t\t\tTRANSACT_ACTIVE <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tTRANSACT_COMPLETE <= 0;\n\t\t\t\t\tTRANSACT_ERROR <= 0;\n\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= (PWRITE) ? WRITE_DATA : READ_DATA;\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t\tREAD_DATA: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tif (!PSEL || !PENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTRANSACT_ACTIVE <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTRANSACT_COMPLETE <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTRANSACT_ERROR <= 0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= IDLE;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= DATA_REG;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t// Hold data valid for the read transaction\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= DATA_REG;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t\tWRITE_DATA: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tif (!PSEL || !PENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTRANSACT_ACTIVE <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTRANSACT_COMPLETE <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTRANSACT_ERROR <= 0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= IDLE;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= 0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t// Update data register on write\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif (PWRITE) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDATA_REG <= PWDATA;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= 0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tendcase\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Output logic for PREADY and PSLVERR based on state\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\tend\n\t\telse begin\n\t\t\tif (STATE == IDLE) begin\n\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\telse if (TRANSACT_ACTIVE) begin\n\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t// Transaction complete, ready for next\n\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>\n<|endoftext|>",
